Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A qubit is a unit of quantum information When we use the\Nbasis we call zero and one we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,can prepare a state associated with zero with one or\Nwith a superposition of those two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,basis states You may hear that a qubit is zero and one\Nat the same time That phrase is an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,approximation that can be confusing It is more careful\Nto say that its state can be a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,quantum combination of the basis states The glowing\Nsphere in our story is only a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,character representing this idea A real qubit can be\Nimplemented using very different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,physical systems such as ions or superconducting\Ncircuits